UID:10535-1792332000-1792346400@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:Tantra Date for Couples: Fall in Love
DESCRIPTION:Couples\, \nThis fall\, slow down… and fall in love again. \nWhen the seasons change\, we feel it in our bodies—cooler air\, shorter days\, a natural pull inward. It’s the perfect time to come home… to yourself and to each other. \nMost couples want more connection—more warmth\, more affection\, more real intimacy. But between busy schedules\, stress\, and “same-old” routines\, it’s easy to drift into autopilot. And the truth is: no one ever taught us the simple skills that keep love alive. \nWelcome to a brand-new\, transformational date experience designed to help you reconnect\, reignite\, and remember what brought you together in the first place. \nThis isn’t talk therapy\, and it’s not a lecture. It’s a guided\, gentle\, playful\, deeply grounding experience where you’ll learn easy\, practical tools to create closeness—tools you can use the very next day at home. \nI also weave in practical\, science-backed relationship tools inspired by the world-renowned Gottman Institute— simple skills that help couples strengthen communication\, build trust\, and keep love alive. \nWhether you’re completely new to Tantra or you’ve attended our events before\, this experience is entirely new and different—crafted to help you shed what’s been weighing you down and step into a fresh season of love. \nTogether\, you’ll be guided through simple embodied practices that strengthen: \n– Emotional connection (feeling seen\, safe\, and understood) \n– Communication (without pressure or “doing it wrong”) \n– Trust + presence (getting out of your head and back into your hearts and bodies) \n– Everyday intimacy (small moments that change everything) \nBy the end of our time together\, you’ll leave feeling more grounded\, open\, connected\, and genuinely close—and you’ll have a set of simple connection rituals you can bring into your relationship again and again… all season long. \nPRIVATE COUPLES COACHING: If you’re going through challenges in your relationship or you’d prefer a private\, personalized experience—private couples coaching is available.  Text Olga at (862) 251-2444 to schedule a free discovery zoom call to see how we can work together. \nDATE: Sunday\, October 18th. \nTIME: 2:00 – 6:00 Doors open at 2:00. We begin at 2:15 \nMore information and registration here! \nCOST: Early Bird $299.00 (plus fees)\, Regular Admission $333.00 \nVENMO or other payment methods are available\, so you don’t have to pay the additional fees. TEXT me (862) 251-2444 to find out how to pay with Venmo or Zelle. \nSPACE IS LIMITED and events are advertised in multiple places. You MUST pre-purchase your ticket. \nLOCATION: The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, NJ 07042 \nBONUS: Couples Zoom Coaching Call with me. Schedule it after the event to help you integrate what you learned\, troubleshoot what gets in the way\, and keep your relationship moving forward together. \nFIRST TIMERS WELCOME CALL with the organizer is required to attend. Please TEXT Olga before ordering tickets. (862) 251-2444. Once we’ve spoken you are ‘IN’ and may attend all future events. Attendance is at the discretion of the organizer. \nWHAT TO BRING: Water Bottle. Wear comfortable clothes that allow movement. \nREFRESHMENTS: Healthy refreshments are provided halfway thought the event. \nPLEASE REFRAIN from wearing scented products to respect those with chemical sensitivities. \nThere is NO NUDITY or sexual touch in this workshop. SAFETY and PERSONAL BOUNDARIES are strictly adhered to at our events. \nREFUNDS: There are NO refunds. TEXT the organizer within 24 hours of the event\, you can use your ticket for our next monthly event. Please TEXT Olga  (862) 251-2444. \nWHAT PARTICIPANTS ARE SAYING: \n-I felt a connection with my spouse I’ve never been able to express with her before. Mike \n-I felt my feelings. I felt truly loved by my spouse. Terry \n-The gentleness of your guidance allowed me to trust in myself and my feelings. Beth \n-I learned simple tools to use in our day-to-day practice. You will leave with more than you came with. Do it!! Venera \n-The pace was excellent. I appreciated the mix of teaching and practice. This was a great experience\, even for the non-spiritual sceptic. It will open your heart and mind in beautiful ways. Bob \n-Take it to help increase openness and communication through shared love and beautiful experiences. Mark \n-Try it! Great practical tools and rituals. There is so much to learn and grow in as a couple. Made me very excited to learn more! Debbie \n-Creating slow time to connect with your partner with guided exercises is so special. Jamie \n-Olga and Bob offer great information\, a loving and safe environment\, and a playful place for couples to find themselves again. Thank you! Maddi \n-It was a great introduction to tantra and developing daily practices to increase and grow intimacy with your partner. Bobby \n-Personal improvement on your relationship\, on how to love better because we aren’t taught how to do so in the first place. JP \n-It’s important to step out of your comfort zone and try something new. This class helps achieve that as well as deeper connectivity and playfulness with your partner. Thank you! Stephanie \n-Great way to be closer to your partner\, great way to get unstuck. It’s just fun! Jim \n-Olga and Bob lead a fantastic workshop for couples to deepen their love and connection and left us with tools to take home and use to continue deeper love. Michael \nMore information and registration here! \nYOUR PRESENTERS \nOlga Ribble is an Intimacy Coach and Certified Skydancing Tantra Presenter. She uses Gottman Method Couples Therapy in her work and has extensive training with world-renowned teachers of relationship and intimacy. She guides couples to develop better communication and intimacy skills\, leading to fulfilling emotional\, physical\, and spiritual partnerships. https://nordicgoddesstantra.com/ \n‘Cool Dude’ Bob a lifelong teacher and student\, spent over a decade delving into the transformative world of Tantra. Through Tantra\, Bob discovered practices that enhance masculine potency\, foster deeper intimacy and pleasure\, offering a holistic approach that enriches personal and relational experiences. He assists his partner Olga in teaching couples and men’s programs.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/tantra-date-for-couples-fall-in-love/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Meditation,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-05-at-8.58.55-PM.png
END:VEVENT
