SUMMARY:The Farewell Party + Potluck Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, October 23\, 6 – 9 pm \nLet’s say farewell to this beautiful room that the Space has grown in for the last three years!  This will be a fun party for everyone in the community to socialize\, share memories\, and have a few laughs.  This will also be a potluck dinner\, so bring something to eat or drink for everyone. \nThis will also be a last look at the last exhibit here\, The Space We Made. \nWe have to be out by the end of October\, but the new tenants have kindly offered us to continue a few classes here.  The Tuesday figure drawing and the open mic will continue\, along with a couple of workshops. \nThe party is free and open to all\, but we are still raising funds for the move and build out of the new Space.  Donations are greatly appreciated and will go a long way\, so if you’re able to contribute anything we will gladly accept it. \nSee you at the party!
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/the-farewell-party-potluck-dinner/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/20260917_170044.jpg
END:VEVENT
